Shop Guide
_
_Navigating the Shop
_-To browse items, navigate to the desired category and expand it using the "+" button.
_-Right-click an item or package to view detailed information before purchasing.
_
_Important Purchase Information
_-All sales are final! There is no refund policy, so please ensure you are selecting the correct item before purchasing.
_
_Need Help?
_-If you have any questions or encounter issues, please contact us on Discord for assistance.